{
  "title": "Burgertown workflows",
  "workflows": [
    {
      "workflowId": "payAtTable",
      "summary": "A. Pay at table",
      "description": "Seeded tbl_4 / chk_ok. Read the due, tender card, capture, invoice.\nTable frees; optional tip and rewards earn."
    },
    {
      "workflowId": "refundThenVoid",
      "summary": "B. Refund then void",
      "description": "Fixture chk_paid / pay_paid / ch_paid. Accept a refund, reverse the\nprocessor charge, then void. Void without a reversed refund is 409\nvoid_not_allowed. API only — no restaurant screen."
    },
    {
      "workflowId": "orderThenKitchen",
      "summary": "C. Order then kitchen",
      "description": "Read the dinner board, open a dine-in check on an empty table, add a\nTownie with selections[], send, bump the ticket. Last ticket done\nmarks the fulfillment ready. itm_86 on add is 409. Send with nothing\nunsent is 409 nothing_to_send."
    },
    {
      "workflowId": "localDiscountThenPay",
      "summary": "D. Local discount then pay",
      "description": "Apply LOCAL10 to chk_ok, re-read due_cents, pay the new due.\nPaying the pre-discount 1736 after the code is 422 amount_mismatch."
    },
    {
      "workflowId": "deliveryEndToEnd",
      "summary": "E. Delivery end to end",
      "description": "Nine hops with three branch points — zone check, courier availability,\nready-gate on pickup. Creates a new delivery fulfillment; does not\nreuse dlv_pending."
    },
    {
      "workflowId": "buildABurger",
      "summary": "F. Build a burger",
      "description": "Same write endpoint as C. Each step below expects a distinct 4xx from\naddItem, then the last step is the valid Townie. Five options in\nmodg_add is in HANDOFF but the live group only has three options, so\nthat row is not a step."
    },
    {
      "workflowId": "rewardsRedeemThenPay",
      "summary": "G. Rewards redemption then pay",
      "description": "The stale-due trap. Redeem off_free_fries on chk_ok, re-fetch the\ncheck, pay the new due. Skipping the re-fetch and paying 1736 is\n422 amount_mismatch. Passing a stale check_version is 409\ncheck_version_stale."
    },
    {
      "workflowId": "deliveryFailedThenRefund",
      "summary": "H. Delivery failed then refund",
      "description": "Fixture dlv_enroute. Fail the job; fulfillment stays ready.\nThe seeded check chk_enroute is unpaid, so the live path is cancel\nfulfillment — inventory is not restocked. HANDOFF also describes a\npaid recovery (refund → processor refund → void). That branch needs\na paid enroute fixture the seed does not have, so it is not a step."
    },
    {
      "workflowId": "guestDietaryFilter",
      "summary": "I. Guest dietary filter",
      "description": "Read-only filter plus one add that warns. Maya avoids alg_dairy and\nis not strict, so a shake still 201s with warnings[]. 409\nallergen_conflict only fires when dietary_profile.strict is true.\nNo guest on the seed is strict, so that 409 is not a step."
    }
  ],
